{"step_index":1499,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-13T07:11:42Z","input_tokens":4786,"cache_read_tokens":48734,"output_tokens":982,"thinking":"Page 1's text content triggered an unexpected \"cleaned > 80\" result, suggesting the cleaning logic is misinterpreting certain content. The goal now is to identify pages containing prologue or chapter headings, to understand the trigger further. The distinction between color galleries and in-story illustrations is being researched using the structure of the Rokudenashi and Konosuba volumes. In Rokudenashi, color pages appear before the main chapter story. In Konosuba, color spreads are on specific pages in the first volume.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"import os, pymupdf, re\\n\\nbase_dir = r\\\"D:\\\\JV\\\\[Ruidrive] Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Bakuen wo!\\\\[Ruidrive] Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Bakuen wo!\\\\[Ruidrive] Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Bakuen wo! - Volume 17.1\\\"\\nvol_keys = ['01', '02', '03', '04', '05', '06', '07', '08', '09', '10', '11', '12', '13', '14', '15', '16', '17', '17.1']\\n\\nall_pdfs = {}\\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk(base_dir):\\n    for f in files:\\n        if f.lower().endswith('.pdf'):\\n            for vk in sorted(vol_keys, key=lambda k: -len(k)):\\n                if re.search(rf\\\"\\\\bVolume\\\\s+{re.escape(vk)}\\\\b\\\", f, re.IGNORECASE):\\n                    if vk not in all_pdfs:\\n                        all_pdfs[vk] = os.path.join(root, f)\\n\\nfor vk in vol_keys:\\n    doc = pymupdf.open(all_pdfs[vk])\\n    xref_pages = {}\\n    for pno in range(len(doc)):\\n        for img in doc[pno].get_images(full=True):\\n            xref = img[0]\\n            if xref not in xref_pages:\\n                xref_pages[xref] = []\\n            xref_pages[xref].append(pno + 1)\\n            \\n    filtered = {}\\n    for xref, pages in xref_pages.items():\\n        b = doc.extract_image(xref)\\n        if b[\\\"width\\\"] > 300 and b[\\\"height\\\"] > 300 and len(b[\\\"image\\\"]) > 30*1024:\\n            filtered[xref] = pages\\n            \\n    # Check multi-page xrefs vs single-page xrefs\\n    multi_page = {x: p for x, p in filtered.items() if len(p) > 1}\\n    single_page = {x: p for x, p in filtered.items() if len(p) == 1}\\n    \\n    print(f\\\"Vol {vk} ({len(doc)} pages): {len(filtered)} total imgs | {len(multi_page)} multi-page (preview+story), {len(single_page)} single-page\\\")\\n    # Show single-page pages\\n    single_pages = sorted([p[0] for p in single_page.values()])\\n    print(f\\\"   Single-page at: {single_pages}\\\")\\n\"","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Eevyx\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\dfaefe40-f699-4276-8717-cb4f8030016c\\\\scratch\\\\test_preview_patterns.py\""}}]}
